        "original_id": "b684a1b2-a821-51f3-8d4b-de2d5c36e282",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Honeymoon Academy, Sex and the City\n- People: Kim Cattrall, Robert Hays\n- Topics: Film and television roles, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Honeymoon Academy, also titled For Better or For Worse, is a 1990 American comedy-drama film.\n- Honeymoon Academy stars Robert Hays and Kim Cattrall.\n- Sex and the City is an HBO romantic comedy series that ran from 1998 to 2004.\n- Kim Cattrall is known for playing Samantha Jones in Sex and the City.\n- Kim Cattrall received five Emmy Award nominations and four Golden Globe Award nominations for Sex and the City.\n- Kim Cattrall won the 2002 Golden Globe Award for Best Supporting Actress for Sex and the City.",
